      "summary": "Palantir co-founder, 8VC managing partner with major defense-tech portfolio",
      "detail": "Joseph Todd Lonsdale V (b. 1982, Fremont, CA) co-founded Palantir Technologies in 2004 with Peter Thiel, Alex Karp, Stephen Cohen, and Nathan Gettings. Founder and managing partner of 8VC, early-stage VC firm managing over 6B in capital, headquartered in Austin TX (relocated from SF in 2020). Sole managing member of 8VC GP I LLC (SEC CIK 0001832823), with voting and dispositive power over all fund holdings. Also founded Cicero Institute (conservative think tank), Cicero Action, Cicero Research, and is president of Arpinum Inc. 8VC portfolio includes defense-tech: Anduril, Saronic, Epirus, Joby Aviation, Senti Biosciences, Palantir.",
